          "sent_at": "2025-05-18T04:40:43",
          "text": "Hi Doctor, \n\nI am reaching out about some chest and breathing discomfort i've been having the past month or so. The feeling is like a tightness in my upper chest which causes me to feel short of breath, and as a result, I feel the need to take very deep breaths, which will often temporarily help for maybe 20 seconds or so. In other words, my standard breathing doesn't feel like it's enough, and so I feel this discomfort. I honestly felt for a while like it was correlated with my anxiety spikes, but now I am not so sure. Figured this is something I should message you about.",
